PACKET MESSAGE GENERATOR
========================

A simple text file message generator to generate an ASCII file with your mail
ready for tx to your TNC via pocket packet or PC. the program builds up
a database of callsigns and addresses you mail to and automatically
addresses and adds a user configurable footer to each message.

Installation
------------
Copy the tow files to your /APP directory and install with the
PSION -I command. The editor is a simple editor for amending/listing
your messages.

